    {
      "abstract": "A summary of worldwide $^3_{\\Lambda}$H lifetime experimental measurements and theoretical calculations. The two star markers are the STAR collaboration\u2019s measurement published in 2010 and the present analysis. This measurement was based on the 3-body decay channel $^3_{\\Lambda}$H\u2192p+d+\u03c0\u2212in a nuclear emulsion experiment. The shorter lifetime was attributed to the dissociation of the lightly-bound \u039b and deuteron when traveling in a dense medium.",
